77000", 2], ["https://files.ecatholic.com/20435/documents/2026/1/SJP%202026%20Fish%20Fry%20Menu.pdf?t=1768643336000", 2], ["https://files.ecatholic.com/21966/pictures/2026/2/Fish%20Fry-1.png?t=1770951875000", 2], ["https://stfaustinaparish.org/lenten-fish-fry", 2], ["https://files.ecatholic.com/21392/documents/2026/2/Fish%20Fry%20Menu%202026.pdf.pdf?t=1769976644000", 2], ["https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=1319278773564383&set=pb.100064468190967.-2207520000", 1], ["https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=1213014857670575&set=pb.100068862168738.-2207520000", 1], ["https://www.facebook.com/photo?fbid=1785476112606669&set=pb.100034328929563.-2207520000", 1], ["https://www.instagram.com/p/DU6vxcVjW9v/?igsh=MWx6ZmRqbWllaGZkag%3D%3D&fbclid=IwY2xjawQFIABleHRuA2FlbQIxMABicmlkETJrWDBEQ1l2aVVENXJzWDIzc3J0YwZhcHBfaWQQMjIyMDM5MTc4ODIwMDg5MgABHvIy3Jxyi3OI6BlLGcinduHF", 1], ["https://badenpost641.org/files/fish-fry-flyer_(5).pdf", 1]], "date_fmt": null}, "MENU_TEXT": {"type": "TEXT", "distinct": 143, "blank": 129, "top": [["Lenten Menu\nAppetizer\nShotgun Shrimp\n Crispy fried shrimp, signature creamy spicy sauce, Asian slaw\n\nEntrees\nFish n Chips\n Beer-battered cod, fries, tartar sauce, cole slaw, lemon\n Complimentary brioc", 3], ["APPETIZERS\nHUSH PUPPIES SERVED WITH HONEY OR COCKTAIL\n$10\nCRAB RANGOON EGGROLLS SERVED WITH THAI CHILI\n$13\nCROWD FAVORITES\nCAPTAIN RAY SHRIMP\nLIGHTLY BREADED SHRIMP FRIED TO PERFECTION TOSSED IN YOUR ", 2], ["Potato, sauerkraut, cottage cheese, and jalapeno pyrohy, $12/dozen\n\nOur hours at 10am-2pm on Thursday and Friday\nCall 412-276-9897 to leave your order\nPlease Provide: Your Name, Phone Number, Pickup D", 1], ["Buffet pricing: Adults $18; Seniors (65+) $15; Kids (10 & under) $13. Single Takeout Meal $15\n", 1], ["6 pm-8pm\nFor takeout orders please call 412-321-1834 from 5:45pm\n\nAlcohol, bottled water and soda can be ordered at the bar or service station near the stage.\n\nHand Breaded Atlantic Cod\nSmall Fried Fi", 1], ["$16 fried or baked fish dinner\nFish dinners include choice of cut fries or baked potato, homemade coleslaw or applesauce, peanut butter cookie\n$13 Palacinke Dinner", 1], ["Fish dinner $16\nFish sandwich $12\nFish & chips (fries) $14", 1], ["Fish specials every Friday 10am-midnight\nBaked or fried cod\nBar and dining room seating & online take-out ", 1], ["All You Can Eat Buffet:\n4:00pm-6:30pm\n- $16 \n- Kids 6-11 $8 \n- 5 and under Free\n\nCall Ahead Fish Fry Orders:\n- You may call from 2:30p - 5:30p the day of the Fish Fry to place your pick up order. Pick", 1], ["Lunch served (smaller menu) 12:00 -- 4:00\n\nDinner Served 4:00 -- 7:30", 1], ["Meal Items\n\nEach meal comes with your choice of TWO sides:\nApplesauce * Clam Chowder * Coleslaw * French Fries * Haluski * Mac & Cheese * Onion Rings * Six Pierogies\n\nBeer Battered Fish * $15\n\nServed ", 1]], "date_fmt": null}, "VENUE_NOTES": {"type": "TEXT", "distinct": 119, "blank": 155, "top": [["eat in or take out", 4], ["dine in or take out", 2], ["Dine in or take out", 1], ["Dine in or take out; call 724-697-4921 for takeout. No smoking.", 1], ["Call ahead beginning at 3:30 PM", 1], ["please use Sherman Ave. entrance (Antonium)", 1], ["Takeout ONLY in 2026. Orders taken for walk-ins and by phone.", 1], ["dine in and online take out ordering", 1], ["all you can eat buffet", 1], ["    We will be open for dine-in. Limited seating available - first come - first served /    We will be open for DRIVE THUR, CALL AHEAD, and DELIVERY./    Call ahead orders - /    Drive-Thru - Fast ord", 1], ["In Parish Life Center Gymnasium. Look for parking crew in orange vests to guide you or park up near the church and walk down.", 1]], "date_fmt": null}, "PHONE": {"type": "TEXT", "distinct": 207, "blank": 61, "top": [["412-828-9846", 3], ["724-677-2400 ", 2], ["724-658-3990", 2], ["724-697-4921", 2], ["412-388-1000", 2], ["412-276-9897 ", 2], ["724-869-0200", 2], ["814-943-2072", 2], [" (412) 321-1834", 2], ["724-342-7391", 2], ["724-375-302